{"sha": "ac1eee04a14a17423e6b3a1df6563cb430b97f1c0868405d319c0df90dd93a02", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:b1:s-block} 章 --- 氢和 s 区元素}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:1}", "\\ce{KH} 和 \\ce{CaH2}：离子型；\\ce{SiH4} 和 \\ce{H2S}：共价型；", "\\ce{PdH_{0.6}}：金属型。\\ce{CaH2 + 2H2O -> Ca(OH)2 + 2H2}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:2}", "\\ce{2Li + 2H2O -> 2LiOH + H2}，Na 和 K 与之相同；", "\\ce{Mg + 2HCl -> MgCl2 + H2}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:3}", "碱性：\\ce{Na2O}、\\ce{MgO}（\\ce{MgO + 2HCl -> MgCl2 + H2O}）。酸性：", "\\ce{SiO2}、\\ce{SO3}、\\ce{CO2}（\\ce{SO3 + H2O -> H2SO4}）。两性：", "\\ce{Al2O3}、\\ce{ZnO}（\\ce{ZnO + 2OH- + H2O -> Zn(OH)4^2-}）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:4}", "pH 为 14 时，水的电对为 \\ce{2H2O + 2e- -> H2 + 2OH-}，$E = -0.83$~V；", "$\\log K = 2(-0.83 + 2.71)/0.059 = 64$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:5}", "在火焰中，碰撞使电子跃迁到激发态；回到", "基态时，原子发射出能量等于能级间隔的光子，", "该能量因元素而异。$E = hc/\\lambda = 6.626 \\times 10^{-34} \\times", "3.00 \\times 10^8/(589 \\times 10^{-9}) = \\qty{3.375e-19}{J} = \\qty{2.11}{eV}$。", "% ledger: const:h, const:c, const:eV", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:6}", "$10^6/106.0 = \\qty{9.43e3}{mol}$ 纯碱：需 \\qty{9.43e3}{mol}", "石灰石，质量为 \\qty{0.944}{t}；另需 $2 \\times 9.43 \\times 10^3/0.90 =", "\\qty{2.10e4}{mol}$ 食盐，质量为 \\qty{1.23}{t}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:7}", "$[\\ce{Mg^2+}] = 1.3/24.3 = \\qty{0.053}{mol/L}$；$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 -", "\\frac12(11.25 + \\log 0.053) = 9.0$。\\qty{1.0}{m^3} 中含 \\qty{53.5}{mol} 镁，", "需 \\qty{53.5}{mol} 的 \\ce{Ca(OH)2}：\\qty{4.0}{kg}。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:8}", "两者的平衡常数（热力学）都极大；反应速率", "（动力学）并不由 $E^\\circ$ 决定。锂的熔点较高，", "保持固态，并被溶解度较小的生成物层覆盖，", "失去电子比钾更难（电离能较高），", "因此反应平稳，钾则剧烈反应。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:9}", "$10^6/100.1 = \\qty{9.99e3}{mol}$：CaO $9.99 \\times 10^3 \\times 56.1 =", "\\qty{0.560}{t}$；\\ce{CO2} 为 \\qty{9.99e3}{mol}，$V = nRT/p = 9.99 \\times 10^3", "\\times 8.314 \\times 298.15/10^5 = \\qty{248}{m^3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:10}", "$2.9 \\times 10^8/6.9 = \\qty{4.2e7}{kmol}$ 锂（质量以 kg 计），$\\times 73.8/2 =", "\\qty{1.55e9}{kg}$：约 160 万吨碳酸锂。", "$2.9 \\times 10^8/8 = \\num{3.6e7}$ 节电池。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:11}", "在 20、80、\\qty{100}{\\celsius} 时，溶解度分别为 1.31%、0.84%、0.71%，", "溶解度随温度升高而降低。热溶液中残留的碳酸锂较少，因此回收得更多。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:s-block:12}", "\\ce{NaHCO3} 是这些离子可形成的盐中溶解度最小的一种，", "溶液会先对它饱和。氨使溶液呈碱性，", "足以使 \\ce{CO2} 转化为 \\ce{HCO3-}，而氨可以回收（以", "\\ce{NH4Cl} 形式存在，由石灰再生）；若用氢氧化钠，则会被消耗，", "成本高于产物本身。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b1:s-block:1}", "\\textbf{1.} Li \\qty{6.0}{g/L}，Mg \\qty{2.4}{g/L}。", "\\textbf{2.} 四立方米卤水可得一立方米产物：三立方米", "水被蒸发。", "\\textbf{3.} 阳光和干燥的气候无偿提供能量。", "\\textbf{4.} 氯化钠是迄今最丰富的盐，", "它最先达到饱和。", "\\textbf{5.} Li $6000/6.9 = \\qty{870}{mol}$；Mg $2400/24.3 = \\qty{98.8}{mol}$。", "\\textbf{6.} 镁会与碳酸根一起沉淀，", "从而污染产物。", "\\textbf{7.} \\ce{Mg^2+ + Ca(OH)2 -> Mg(OH)2 + Ca^2+}。", "\\textbf{8.} $98.8 \\times 74.1 = \\qty{7.32}{kg}$。", "\\textbf{9.} 剩余 $[\\ce{Mg^2+}] = \\num{9.88e-5}$ mol/L：$\\mathrm{pH} = 14.00 -", "\\frac12(11.25 - 4.01) = 10.38$。", "\\textbf{10.} 氢氧化锂可溶：在此 pH 下不会析出固体。", "\\textbf{11.} \\ce{Ca^2+ + CO3^2- -> CaCO3}。", "\\textbf{12.} $98.8 \\times 106.0 = \\qty{10.5}{kg}$。", "\\textbf{13.} \\ce{2Li+ + CO3^2- -> Li2CO3}。", "\\textbf{14.} $435 \\times 106.0 = \\qty{46.1}{kg}$。", "\\textbf{15.} $435 \\times 73.8 = \\qty{32.1}{kg}$。", "\\textbf{16.} 碳酸锂在热水中溶解度较小。", "\\textbf{17.} $0.0084 \\times 1000 = \\qty{8.4}{kg}$。", "\\textbf{18.} 用少量热水，", "碳酸锂在其中溶解度最小。", "\\textbf{19.} $32.1 - 8.4 = \\qty{23.7}{kg}$。", "\\textbf{20.} $23.7/32.1 = \\qty{74}{\\percent}$。", "\\textbf{21.} 卤水中仍含锂：它被送回蒸发池。", "\\textbf{22.} $2.9 \\times 10^8/6.0 = \\num{4.8e7}$ 立方米。", "\\textbf{23.} 每立方米可得碳酸锂 \\textbf{\\qty{24}{kg}}", "（23.7）。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}